      "parent": "C01B3/0005",
      "ja": "｛吸着媒体を特徴とするもの；それらの処理｝",
      "en": "characterised by the uptaking media; Treatment thereof<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br>Group C01B3/001 is impacted by reclassification into group C01B3/0018. <br>Groups C01B3/001 and C01B3/0018 should be considered in order to perform a complete search.",
