    "C01B25/461": {
      "code": "C01B25/461",
      "level": 10,
      "parent": "C01B25/46",
      "ja": "｛生成されたまたは分離された液層から最初に抽出され，ついで水を使用して遊離酸としてまたは塩基を使用してりん酸塩として再抽出された反応後に得られた媒体中に存在するりん酸（酸中の不純物の除去Ｃ０１Ｂ２５／２３７）｝．．．｛注．．．．１．抽出剤はりん酸の溶媒でない化合物または化合物の混合物，例．炭化水素，で希釈されてもよい。．．．２．Ｃ０１Ｂ２５／４６２ないしＣ０１Ｂ２５／４６６のサブグループのひとつ以上に属する文献は組み合わせ，例．Ｃ０１Ｂ２５／４６２＋Ｂ４＋Ｂ８，により分類される｝",
      "en": "{the phosphoric acid present in the medium obtained after reaction being first extracted from the liquid phase formed or separated then re-extracted as free acid by using water or as a phosphate by using a basic compound (selective extraction of impurities contained in acid C01B25/237)}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>The extracting agent may be diluted with a compound or a mixture of compounds which are not solvents for phosphoric acid, e.g. a hydrocarbon.<br>Documents which belong to more than one subgroup of C01B25/462&#160;-&#160;C01B25/466 are classified by a combination, e.g. C01B25/462 +B4+B8.",
      "count": 78,
      "ipcCode": "C01B25/46",
      "coreCode": "C01B25/46",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C01B.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
