      "level": 9,
      "parent": "C01B33/20",
      "ja": "アルカリ金属けい酸塩　（｛Ｃ０１Ｂ３３／２０Ｂ(ＥＣＬＡ)｝，Ｃ０１Ｂ３３／２６が優先）｝",
      "en": "Alkali metal silicates ({C01B33/24} , C01B33/26 take precedence)",
