      "level": 8,
      "parent": "C04B41/00",
      "ja": "｛冷却，例．凍結｝<br><br><u>注</u><br><br>このグループにおいて，冷却は，追加的な冷却処理の意味で用いられ，セラミックの焼結のような加熱工程を含む材料の製造における通常の冷却とは区別される。",
      "en": "{Cooling, e.g. freezing}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group the term \"cooling\" is used in the sense of an additional cooling treatment, different from the traditional cooling step in the fabrication of materials involving a heating step, such as sintering of ceramics.",
