      "ja": "｛ヘンケル反応またはその関連反応，すなわち，一酸化炭素または二酸化炭素の存在化または不存在下での６員芳香環に結合したカルボン酸塩の基の転移反応（例．ベンゾエートからのテレフタレートの製造）その後の塩基の加水分解の分類は不要｝",
      "en": "{Henkel reaction and related reactions, i.e. rearrangement of carboxylate salt groups linked to six-membered aromatic rings, in the absence or in the presence of CO or CO2, (e.g. preparation of terepholates from benzoates); no additional classification for the subsequent hydrolysis of the salt groups has to be given}",
      "count": 229,
      "ipcCode": "C07C51/41",
      "coreCode": "C07C51/41",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C07C.txt",
