      "en": "Heterocyclic compounds containing hydrogenated pyridine rings, not condensed with other rings<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group, the following term is used with the meaning indicated: <br>\"hydrogenated\" means having less than three double bonds between ring members or between ring members and non-ring members.<br> Piperidines having only hydrogen atoms attached to the ring carbon atoms are classified in C07D295/00",
