      "ja": "｛１７－β位が２個の炭素原子からなる中断されない鎖で置換されたもの，例．プレグナン誘導体｝　",
      "en": "{the 17-beta position being substituted by an uninterrupted chain of only two carbon atoms, e.g. pregnane derivatives}",
      "count": 427,
      "ipcCode": "C07J41/00",
      "coreCode": "C07J41/00",
      "note": "",
