      "en": "Compositions of homopolymers or copolymers of compounds having one or more unsaturated aliphatic radicals, each having only one carbon-to-carbon double bond, and containing boron, silicon, phosphorus, selenium, tellurium or a metal; Compositions of derivatives of such polymers (of metal salts, e.g. phenolates, alcoholates, see the parent compounds)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group, C-Sets are used.<br>The detailed information about the C-Sets construction and the associated syntax rules is present in the Definitions of C08L. ",
