      "en": "Compositions of homopolymers or copolymers of compounds having no unsaturated aliphatic radicals in side chain, and having one or more carbon-to-carbon double bonds in a carbocyclic or in a heterocyclic ring system; Compositions of derivatives of such polymers (of cyclic anhydrides or imides C08L35/00; of cyclic esters of polyfunctional acids C08L31/00)<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group, C-Sets are used.<br>The detailed information about the C-Sets construction and the associated syntax rules is present in the Definitions of C08L.",
