      "en": "Anti-slip materials; Abrasives {(products specifically intended for the fabrication of abrasive tools, blocks or papers, or for operations of the kind of sand-blasting and barrelling B24B31/14, B24C1/00; polishing compositions containing abrasive or grinding agents C09G1/02; friction compositions for brakes or clutches F16D69/02; polishing of semi-conductors H10P52/40)}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In this group, boron and silicon are considered as being metals. Likewise for associations of carbon with metals, e.g. carbides.",
