      "en": "{Bleach activators or bleach catalysts}<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>In the absence of an indication to the contrary activators or catalysts are classified in the last appropriate place.<br>In case of mixtures or a list of alternatives documents are classified in C11D3/3905 or C11D3/3907 only and the individual alternatives are classified with additional symbols from C11D3/3907 - C11D3/3932.",
