      "en": "Apparatus for enzymology or microbiology<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>This group covers: <br>apparatus where microorganisms or enzymes are produced or isolated;<br>apparatus where the characteristics of microorganisms or enzymes are investigated, e.g. which growth factors are necessary;<br>apparatus specially adapted to employ microorganisms or enzymes as \"reactants\" or biocatalysts;<br>apparatus of both laboratory and industrial scale.",
