    "C12N2500/99": {
      "code": "C12N2500/99",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "C12N2500/00",
      "ja": "無血清培養基<br><br><u>通告</u><br>このグループは２０１２年１月１日時点，新文献の分類にはもはや使用されていない。このグループのバックログは，引き続きＣ１２Ｎ２５００／９０～Ｃ１２Ｎ２５００／９８に再分類中である",
      "en": "Serum-free medium<br><br><u>WARNING</u><br> This group is no longer used for the classification of new documents as from 2012-01-01. The backlog of this group is being continuously reclassified to C12N2500/90&#160;-&#160;C12N2500/98",
      "count": 252,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "C12N2500/99",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C12N.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "C12N2501/00": {
      "code": "C12N2501/00",
      "level": 7,
      "parent": null,
      "ja": "細胞培養プロセス，例．分化，に使用される活性剤<br>注．<br>　いつでも可能であれば，インデクセーションは化学構造によってではなく情報伝達経路により行なわれる，　例．　蛋白質のグループはそのペプチド類似体およびＣ０７Ｋ１４／００内にあるような対応する核酸を包含するだけでなく，抗体，抗イディオタイプ抗体，受容体の非ペプチドリガンド，受容体それ自身，受容体に対する抗体，　または蛋白質前駆体を処理する変換酵素の阻害剤をも包含する。別の方法で分類されない限り，リガンドおよび基質は受容体および酵素に優先する。",
      "en": "Active agents used in cell culture processes, e.g. differentation<br><br><u>NOTE</u><br><br>Whenever possible, indexation is done by signalling pathway and not by chemical structure, e.g. the group of a protein covers not only peptide analogs of it and the corresponding nucleic acids, as in C07K14/00, but also antibodies, anti-idiotypic antibodies, non-peptide ligands of the receptor, the receptor itself, antibodies against the receptor or inhibitors of the conversion enzyme which processes the protein precursor. Unless otherwise provided for, ligands and substrates take precedence over receptors and enzymes.",
      "count": 139,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "C12N2501/00",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C12N.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
    "C12N2501/01": {
      "code": "C12N2501/01",
      "level": 8,
      "parent": "C12N2501/00",
      "ja": "ｃＡＭＰまたはｃＧＭＰのモジュレーター，例．非加水分解性類似体，ホスホジエステラーゼ阻害剤，コレラ毒素",
      "en": "Modulators of cAMP or cGMP, e.g. non-hydrolysable analogs, phosphodiesterase inhibitors, cholera toxin",
      "count": 741,
      "ipcCode": "CPCONLY",
      "coreCode": "C12N2501/01",
      "note": "",
      "sourceFile": "cpc_C12N.txt",
      "kind": "cpc"
    },
